~ start
if not StoryFlags.met_fake_robot
	=> first_chat
else
	=> nothing_to_say

~ first_chat
???: Hey kid
Roadie: Who are you?
???: That depends, you own this joint?
Roadie: No, that guy just died. Like less than 2 hours ago or something
???: You inheriting the joint?
Roadie: No. Again, who are you?
Fake Robot: I am the Gnosh Network's Original V1. Food review HUMAN, NOT ROBOT
Fake Robot: Who reviewed the food
Fake Robot: BEFORE THE BOTS DID
Roadie: Well, i'm the detective for this mess, and i'll be asking some questions
Fake Robot: You? Solve all this? We're gonna be here all night
Roadie: Why are you in a cardboard robot costume?
Fake Robot: I wanted my job back and thought that maybe if I looked the part they'd take me back
Fake Robot: Y'now, like the robot tv star thing is just what the people want to see
Fake Robot: And if I can play a robot convincingly enough they'd put me back on air
Roadie: Good luck with that
$> StoryFlags.met_fake_robot = true
=> END

~ nothing_to_say
Fake Robot: You got a question for me? I didn't do anything, just been watching that robot all night
Roadie: Not yet...
Fake Robot: Well, then move along pal
=> END

~ default_pizza
Fake Robot: Not much of a pizza fan
Roadie: You used to do televised food reviews and you don't like pizza?
Fake Robot: Ever heard of how actors spit food out between takes because they do like 500 of them?
Roadie: ...
Fake Robot: It's not about the food, its about the camera prescence kid
Roadie: Nothing to say about the case?
Fake Robot: Move along pal
=> END

~ bolt_pizza
Fake Robot: HEY I TOLD YOU TO KEEP THAT AWAY FROM ME
Roadie: Keep this away? This pizza right here?
Fake Robot: I'm NOT SOME KINDA BOT PAL DON'T FEED ME THAT
Roadie: What about a little? Just a little bite? Here try it
Fake Robot: AW HELL NAH! GET OUT OF HERE KID!
Roadie: >=)
=> END

~ have_bolts
Fake Robot: You putting bolts on pizza kid?
Roadie: No, at least not yet. Maybe if I get really bored
Fake Robot: Well don't feed one to me pal, noooooooooo thank you. I don't like pizza
Roadie: or bolts?
Fake Robot: Especially pizza. With bolts.
Roadie: Know anyone who would?
Fake Robot: I think we know who would kid, either him or me
Roadie: Him?
Fake Robot: Move along pal
=> END

~ harrys_devils
Fake Robot: Kid, I gotta tell you something before the investigation moves further
Roadie: Yes?
Fake Robot: Can you frame that kid with the angel and the devil on his shoulder for the murder?
Roadie: What?
Fake Robot: Those little devils are nothing but trouble! They've been a pain in my posterior ever since I came in
Fake Robot: They were pulling on my disguise and harassing me! There used to be a foam finger on this hand you know that?
Fake Robot: Not anymore! They ripped it off and threw it out the window! Now it must be all soggy outside in a gutter while i'm locked in here!
Roadie: I'm not going to frame them, but thanks for the info anyways.
=> END